            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This error is an indication of development version of 0.10 is installed on the MacOS machine, but not on Linux one. Updating Neovim to a stable 0.10 (or at least the development version after neovim/neovim#28227 was merged).\r\n\r\nClosing as duplicate of #901.",
