        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I reiterate: it is not *quite* that development version of 0.10 is not recent enough. Released versions 0.8+ before that **are** supported.\n\nIt is that, generally speaking, development version of already released version number is not officially supported.",
